        "descriptions": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "value": "A vulnerability was identified in Totolink WA300 5.2cu.7112_B20190227. Impacted is the function setWebWlanIdx of the file /cgi-bin/cstecgi.cgi of the component POST Request Handler. The manipulation of the argument webWlanIdx leads to command injection. The attack may be initiated remotely. The exploit is publicly available and might be used."
          }
